{"_id":"68a736128ec3d8323af1488d","roadmapSlug":"data-analyst","nodeId":"Fwwve0j-KDfc605IIgmil","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:06:58.099Z","description":"# Parallel Processing\n\nParallel processing divides a computation into tasks that run simultaneously across multiple processors or machines. It is the core technique that makes big data processing feasible, as tasks that would take hours on a single machine can complete in minutes when distributed. Spark and Hadoop both use parallelism to handle large-scale data.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"What Is Parallel Processing?","url":"https://www.spiceworks.com/tech/iot/articles/what-is-parallel-processing/","_id":"6a7f4a4fcb44947debcf5a63"},{"type":"article","title":"How Parallel Computing Works","url":"https://computer.howstuffworks.com/parallel-processing.htm","_id":"6a7f4a4fcb44947debcf5a64"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:03:11.488Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a8894ecaca636c6b9e973f1","title":"DataCamp - Associate Data Analyst in SQL","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/1GK1qD"},{"_id":"6a5e04dcfb5fcb94d041675b","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/AgYmJK"},{"_id":"6a5e189a077863512aba4c73","title":"roadmap.sh - Master SQL","partner":"roadmap.sh","type":"course","url":"https://roadmap.sh/courses/sql"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/data-analyst/content/Fwwve0j-KDfc605IIgmil.md"}